        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Trends in Our Business and Financial Effect",
        "text_hash": "d5dc915fb8146e592fef5b96af6589e6aaccf9bb37c6b15ca362634ac23a79eb",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000400-e6220e52",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[423]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 400,
        "reported_page": 28,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_79",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "The following long-term trends have contributed to the results of our consolidated operations, and we anticipate that they will continue to affect our future results:",
        "text_hash": "e6220e52e0a1268974c288424b556b1da26476be6549dc8b7184cb9c23a2e392",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000401-f0abc0b4",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[424]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 401,
        "reported_page": 28,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_79",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "10pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•As we continue to grow our business and meet the evolving behaviors and needs of our users and customers, our revenue growth and mix along with our cost and margin profiles are being influenced by a number of factors, including:",
        "text_hash": "f0abc0b4274b9b88e71a698405f2a1c2ec4f88afff13910604335dc8ac0cdcec",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000402-1e11d4d5",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[425]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 402,
        "reported_page": 28,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_79",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-style": "italic",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "22.5pt",
          "text-align": "justify"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Expanded AI Offerings in our Products and Services: The continuing evolution of the online world has contributed to the growth of our business. We expect that this evolution, including user engagement with AI products and services, will continue to benefit our business and our revenues. As we continue to incorporate AI into our products and services, such as with AI Overviews and AI Mode in Search, and with enterprise AI solutions on our Google Cloud Platform, we may monetize differently than our historical consumer and enterprise offerings which could affect revenue growth rates and margin trends. When developing new products and services we generally focus first on user experience and then on monetization. At the same time, we face increasing competition, including from other developers and providers of AI products and services, which may affect our revenues.",
        "text_hash": "1e11d4d5bae66cd558702f8152cbc5e8291a68b8044e8ba8d1ed4687769915a4",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000403-f57f4fb3",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[426]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 403,
        "reported_page": 28,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_79",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-style": "italic",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "22.5pt",
          "text-align": "justify"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Increasing Revenues Beyond Advertising: Revenues from cloud, consumer subscriptions, platforms, and devices, which may have differing characteristics than our advertising revenues, have grown over time. Certain of these revenues have been growing at a rate higher than our advertising revenues, becoming a larger percentage of our consolidated revenues, and we expect this trend to continue. The margins on these revenues vary significantly and are generally lower than the margins on our advertising revenues.",
        "text_hash": "f57f4fb3703b70ae2bcdb3f258e8bf7ce315469b4dc240ca0555c675843023c2",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000404-e7c12495",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[427]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 404,
        "reported_page": 28,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_79",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-style": "italic",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "22.5pt",
          "text-align": "justify"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Increased Investment in Technical Infrastructure: We continue to invest in capital expenditures as we scale our technical infrastructure, in particular for AI, to meet the demand of our users and enterprise customers and to support research internally. We invested heavily in capital expenditures in 2025 and in 2026, we expect to significantly increase, relative to 2025, our investment in our technical infrastructure, including servers and network equipment, and data centers. The costs associated with operating our technical infrastructure - depreciation, energy, equipment, and network capacity - are expected to significantly increase as developing and serving AI offerings require more compute power than our historical consumer and enterprise offerings. While our technical infrastructure costs increase, we expect to continue to drive efficiencies in our data centers, for example, through the design of our AI models and our TPU and GPU-based technical infrastructure.",
        "text_hash": "e7c12495a9c202753be70a5566aa83d89aee4ad3bee0e59cfdc386947b8174f4",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000405-8d49677b",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[428]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 405,
        "reported_page": 28,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_79",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-style": "italic",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "22.5pt",
          "text-align": "justify"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Continued Investment in Intellectual Property through R&D and Acquisitions: We continue to make significant research and development investments in areas of strategic focus as we seek to develop new, innovative offerings, and improve our existing offerings across our businesses. Acquisitions and strategic investments remain important elements in our use of capital and contribute to the breadth and depth of our offerings, expand our expertise in engineering and other functional areas, and build strong partnerships around strategic initiatives.",
        "text_hash": "8d49677b5819da824a9f9d2d7e753657e74037e0267a87d685fae8d23b3d122d",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000406-f47ad6bb",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[429]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 406,
        "reported_page": 28,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_79",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-style": "italic",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "22.5pt",
          "text-align": "justify"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Traffic Acquisition Costs Growth and Rate Changes: We expect traffic acquisition costs (\"TAC\") paid to our distribution partners and Google Network partners to increase as our advertising revenues grow. Our overall TAC as a percentage of our advertising revenues (\"TAC rate\") has been decreasing primarily due to a revenue mix",
        "text_hash": "f47ad6bb18e6f12d703b363839fc7f9fb77673f645fad41c8f99bd3820304e1d",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000407-b44c04fe",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[430]/div/div",
        "image_asset_id": null,
